[0m[49m[38;5;10m+    646[0m:[38;5;10m[49m     // `users` ends exactly where `user_count` begins. A 40-byte password on the
[0m[49m[38;5;10m+    647[0m:[38;5;10m[49m     // tenth user puts its NUL terminator on user_count's low byte, zeroing the
