[0m[49m[38;5;10m+    665[0m:[38;5;10m[49m     // then `files`; `files` is immediately followed by `file_count`. So an
[0m[49m[38;5;10m+    666[0m:[38;5;10m[49m     // overflowing strcpy can overwrite the counter that the very next
[0m[49m[38;5;10m+    667[0m:[38;5;10m[49m     // statement uses as an array subscript, producing a wild store.
[0m[49m[38;5;10m+    668[0m:[38;5;10m[49m 
